    "body": "Rework the RDR2 Items list-detail view.\\n\\nLeft master list: four separate columns in this order: Name / Item, ID, Group, Category.\\n\\nRight detail pane: remove the In-game name / item label and let the identity block use the full pane width. Make the editable name larger. Under it, align the internal ID to the left and Group · Category to the right, matching the name input edges. Rename In-game description to Description.",
